{"id":"vd-a1-a-cake-for-mom","level":"a1","n":1,"title":{"en":"Let's Make Something Else!","vi":"Mình làm món khác đi!"},"summary":"Chiếc bánh sinh nhật mặn chát vì nhầm muối với đường — còn một tiếng nữa mẹ về, bố và hai chị em phải nghĩ ra món khác.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-a-cake-for-mom","level":"a1","title":{"en":"A Cake for Mom","vi":"Chiếc bánh tặng mẹ"}},"scene":{"background":"kitchen","props":[{"id":"cake","x":840}]},"cast":{"ruby":{"name":{"en":"Ruby","vi":"Ruby"},"look":"girl","x":360,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#7A4A2A","top":"#F08FB0"}},"finn":{"name":{"en":"Finn","vi":"Finn"},"look":"boy","x":600,"style":{"hairColor":"#C98A3C","top":"#5DBB63","topShade":"#4AA350","collar":"#4AA350"}},"dad":{"name":{"en":"Dad","vi":"Bố"},"look":"dad","x":1160,"style":{"top":"#4F8FD8","topShade":"#3C77BD","collar":"#EAF2FB"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"finn","en":"Mmm… Oh no! This cake is terrible!","vi":"Ưm… Ôi không! Cái bánh này kinh quá!","ipa":["m̩","oʊ","noʊ","ðɪs","keɪk","ɪz","ˈtɛɹəbəl"],"start":0.554,"end":5.524,"expression":"surprised","prop":"cake","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,2.012],[2,2.239],[3,3.716],[4,4.086],[5,4.498],[6,4.739]]},{"speaker":"ruby","en":"What? Let me try.","vi":"Sao cơ? Để chị nếm thử.","ipa":["wʌt","lɛt","mi","tɹaɪ"],"start":6.314,"end":8.734,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,6.314],[1,7.705],[2,7.989],[3,8.202]]},{"speaker":"ruby","en":"Yuck! It is not sweet at all!","vi":"Eo ơi! Chẳng ngọt tí nào!","ipa":["jʌk","ɪt","ɪz","nɑt","swit","æt","ɔl"],"start":9.274,"end":12.384,"expression":"angry","gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,9.274],[1,10.643],[2,10.828],[3,11.013],[4,11.425],[5,11.865],[6,12.021]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"Finn, what did you put in the cake?","vi":"Finn, con cho gì vào bánh thế?","ipa":["fɪn","wʌt","dɪd","ju","pʊt","ɪn","ðə","keɪk"],"start":13.174,"end":15.204,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,13.174],[1,13.782],[2,13.938],[3,14.151],[4,14.293],[5,14.521],[6,14.62],[7,14.762]]},{"speaker":"finn","en":"The sugar, Dad. From the white box.","vi":"Đường ạ. Ở trong hộp màu trắng.","ipa":["ðə","ˈʃʊɡɚ","dæd","fɹʌm","ðə","waɪt","bɑks"],"start":15.994,"end":19.954,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,15.994],[1,16.085],[2,16.995],[3,18.479],[4,18.834],[5,18.976],[6,19.345]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"The white box? That is the salt!","vi":"Hộp màu trắng á? Đó là muối mà!","ipa":["ðə","waɪt","bɑks","ðæt","ɪz","ðə","sɔlt"],"start":20.744,"end":23.984,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,20.744],[1,20.82],[2,21.132],[3,22.702],[4,23.113],[5,23.298],[6,23.454]]},{"speaker":"ruby","en":"Mom is coming home at twelve. What can we do?","vi":"Mười hai giờ mẹ về rồi. Mình làm gì bây giờ?","ipa":["mɑm","ɪz","ˈkʌmɪŋ","hoʊm","æt","twɛlv","wʌt","kæn","wi","du"],"start":24.774,"end":29.094,"expression":"worried","thoughtBubble":"clock:11:00","timing":[[0,24.774],[1,25.16],[2,25.387],[3,25.813],[4,26.253],[5,26.466],[6,28.121],[7,28.405],[8,28.604],[9,28.76]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"Don't worry. Let's make something else.","vi":"Đừng lo. Mình làm món khác đi.","ipa":["doʊnt","ˈwɝi","lɛts","meɪk","ˈsʌmθɪŋ","ɛls"],"start":29.884,"end":33.064,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,29.884],[1,30.102],[2,31.671],[3,31.984],[4,32.211],[5,32.68]]},{"speaker":"finn","en":"Let's use fruit! We have apples and bananas.","vi":"Mình dùng trái cây đi! Nhà có táo với chuối mà.","ipa":["lɛts","juz","fɹut","wi","hæv","ˈæpəlz","ənd","bəˈnænəz"],"start":33.854,"end":38.214,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,33.854],[1,34.163],[2,34.518],[3,36.03],[4,36.272],[5,36.556],[6,37.181],[7,37.38]]},{"speaker":"ruby","en":"And ice cream!","vi":"Còn kem nữa!","ipa":["ənd","aɪs","kɹim"],"start":39.004,"end":40.134,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,39.004],[1,39.215],[2,39.57]]},{"speaker":"ruby","en":"Let's put the fruit on the ice cream.","vi":"Mình xếp trái cây lên kem đi.","ipa":["lɛts","pʊt","ðə","fɹut","ɑn","ðə","aɪs","kɹim"],"start":40.674,"end":43.024,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,40.674],[1,40.959],[2,41.228],[3,41.356],[4,41.782],[5,41.995],[6,42.123],[7,42.493]]},{"speaker":"dad","en":"Good idea, Ruby! Can you cut the bananas?","vi":"Ý hay đấy, Ruby! Con cắt chuối được không?","ipa":["ɡʊd","aɪˈdiə","ˈɹubi","kæn","ju","kʌt","ðə","bəˈnænəz"],"start":43.814,"end":47.734,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,43.814],[1,43.952],[2,44.691],[3,46.203],[4,46.445],[5,46.615],[6,46.899],[7,47.041]]},{"speaker":"ruby","en":"OK! Finn, you wash the apples.","vi":"Vâng ạ! Finn, em rửa táo nhé.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","fɪn","ju","wɑʃ","ðə","ˈæpəlz"],"start":48.524,"end":52.274,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,48.524],[1,50.024],[2,50.749],[3,50.933],[4,51.374],[5,51.53]]},{"speaker":"finn","en":"OK. But let's not use the white box!","vi":"Vâng. Nhưng đừng dùng cái hộp trắng nữa nhé!","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","bʌt","lɛts","nɑt","juz","ðə","waɪt","bɑks"],"start":53.064,"end":56.994,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","react":{"dad":"happy","ruby":"happy"},"timing":[[0,53.064],[1,54.536],[2,54.82],[3,55.161],[4,55.53],[5,55.871],[6,56.013],[7,56.368]]}],"words":[{"id":"terrible","en":"terrible","ipa":"ˈtɛɹəbəl","vi":"kinh khủng; tồi tệ","level":0},{"id":"sugar","en":"sugar","ipa":"ˈʃʊɡɚ","vi":"đường","level":0},{"id":"fruit","en":"fruit","ipa":"fɹut","vi":"trái cây, quả; thành quả","level":0},{"id":"idea","en":"idea","ipa":"aɪˈdiə","vi":"ý tưởng; ý kiến; ý niệm","level":0},{"en":"salt","ipa":"sɔlt","vi":"muối"}],"focus":{"title":"Đưa ra gợi ý với \"Let's\"","pattern":"Let's + động từ… · Let's not + động từ… · Good idea!","explain":"\"Let's\" (= let us) rủ mọi người cùng làm một việc, theo sau là động từ nguyên thể: \"Let's make…\", \"Let's use…\". Đồng ý thì đáp \"Good idea!\" hoặc \"OK!\".","keys":["let's","good idea"],"lines":[7,8,10,11,13]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a1-a-cake-for-mom.mp3","v":"4a952578ac","duration":58.08,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}